      "writtenOn": "2025-08-28T09:25:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes Correct, The CL implementation is looking to pause/stop the charging routine when the temp is critical. I have only checked for the `charging_max_c` and `charging_min_c`. since our only concern is to check if charging the battery is okay or not. \n\nI\u0027ll rename the flag to `EC_BATT_FLAG_CHARGING_TEMP_CRITICAL`",
